# Build output — rebuilt by `pnpm build` / the package's own build script.
/lib/

# Promotional media: README screenshots and demo videos. Kept on disk because
# the README renders them, but this repo is a private self-use fork and does not
# carry its upstream's marketing surface in version control. `files` in
# package.json lists only `docs/skill-config.md`, so none of this reaches the
# published tarball. Re-fetch from the upstream clone if a README edit needs
# them back.
/docs/images/
/docs/videos/

# Local packaging artifacts
*.tgz
